 "takeaways": [
  "Coordinate bond: the shared pair comes from one atom (donor) and is drawn as an arrow to the acceptor.",
  "Examples: H₃O⁺, H₃N → BF₃, NH₄⁺.",
  "When a coordinate bond breaks, both electrons go to the donor."
 ]
